      "cardDescription": "A hidden-gem Thai tasting experience where the evening is guided by the chef rather than an à-la-carte menu.",
      "content": {
        "about": "The Gallery is not a conventional restaurant. Set high on the hillside above Koh Tao’s west coast, it welcomes a small number of guests for an intimate evening of traditional Thai cuisine, panoramic views and carefully introduced courses.",
        "recommendation": "Choose The Gallery when you want a dining experience rather than simply a meal. Its Trust the Chef format unfolds across around ten courses, with each dish selected and introduced by the restaurant. It is especially well suited to a romantic evening, a celebration or guests who want to explore Thai food in greater depth.",
        "localTip": "The road climbs a steep hill, so booking a taxi is the most comfortable option for many guests. Reservations are essential and should be requested at least one full day ahead. There is no à-la-carte menu.",
        "perfectFor": [
          "Romantic dinner",
          "Special occasions",
          "Thai tasting experience",
          "Quiet evening",
          "Food-focused travellers"
        ],
        "aiSummary": "The Gallery is a reservation-only hidden-gem Thai tasting restaurant on a steep hillside. It offers a Trust the Chef experience of around ten courses, has no à-la-carte menu, and is best for romantic dinners and special occasions. Guests should book at least one day ahead and consider a taxi.",
        "aiKeywords": [
          "special dinner",
          "romantic",
